<!-- 编辑收货地址（v5「字重」稿 A7）：凹槽输入框 + 地区选择 + 默认开关（键帽滑块+紫灯）；底部 删除（按住）/保存。
     所在地区＝微信内置 <picker mode="region"> 省市区级联（全国数据运行时自带·region 空格拼接为真相源）。
     maxlength 与云端 createOrder 地址快照截断一致：表单比云端宽，多打的字会在下单时被悄悄截掉。 -->
<v5-nav title="{{title}}" />

<view class="ae">
  <view class="ae-field">
    <text class="ae-label">收货人</text>
    <input class="well ae-input" value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bind:input="onInput" maxlength="40"
      placeholder="姓名" placeholder-class="ae-ph" />
  </view>
  <view class="ae-field">
    <text class="ae-label">手机号</text>
    <input class="well ae-input ae-mono {{phoneErr ? 'ae-warn' : ''}}" value="{{phone}}" data-field="phone" bind:input="onInput"
      type="number" maxlength="20" placeholder="11 位手机号" placeholder-class="ae-ph" />
    <view wx:if="{{phoneErr}}" class="ae-err">
      <px-anim name="alert" size="2" hold="400" />
      <text>{{phoneErr}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="ae-field">
    <text class="ae-label">所在地区</text>
    <picker mode="region" value="{{regionArr}}" bind:change="onRegionChange">
      <view class="well ae-region">
        <text class="ae-region-t {{region ? '' : 'ae-ph'}}">{{region || '省 / 市 / 区'}}</text>
        <text class="ae-pick">选择</text>
        <px-i name="arrow" tone="#62625c" />
      </view>
    </picker>
  </view>
  <view class="ae-field">
    <text class="ae-label">详细地址</text>
    <input class="well ae-input" value="{{detail}}" data-field="detail" bind:input="onInput" maxlength="120"
      placeholder="街道、门牌号" placeholder-class="ae-ph" />
  </view>
  <view class="ae-def" bind:tap="onToggleDefault">
    <text class="ae-def-t">设为默认地址</text>
    <view class="well ae-switch">
      <view class="k k-light ae-knob {{isDefault ? 'on' : ''}}">
        <px-i wx:if="{{isDefault}}" name="led" tone="#8a5ae0" />
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="ae-dock-space"></view>
<view class="ae-dock">
  <view wx:if="{{id}}" class="k k-light k-48 ae-del {{deleting ? 'ae-del-on' : ''}}"
    catch:touchstart="onDelHoldStart" catch:touchend="onDelHoldEnd" catch:touchcancel="onDelHoldCancel">
    <view class="ae-del-fill"></view>
    <text class="ae-del-t">删除</text>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{valid}}" class="k k-ink k-48 ae-save" hover-class="k-ink-down" hover-stay-time="100" bind:tap="onSave">保存</view>
  <view wx:else class="k k-flat k-48 ae-save" hover-class="k-flat-down" hover-stay-time="100" bind:tap="onSave">保存</view>
</view>
